%% Workflow 1 — New module / feature development
flowchart TD
    A["BRD + Mockup + Standards"] --> B["/feature-plan\n(fresh chat)"]
    B --> C{"Human reviews\ndocuments"}
    C -- "needs changes" --> B
    C -- "approved" --> D["/implement\n(fresh chat)"]
    D --> E["/verify\n(fresh chat)"]
    E --> F{"Verdict"}
    F -- "has FAILs" --> G["/fix\n(same or fresh chat)"]
    G --> E
    F -- "ALL PASS" --> H["Human acceptance\nDone!"]
